1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,543
Narrator: In the magical garden, two birds danced above the flowers.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,357
Aarav: What a lovely sound! Is someone singing in the garden?

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,159
Aanya: That is the birds, Aarav! They sing when the garden wakes up.

4
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,776
Aarav: Hi, Aanya! Look how they flap their wings.

5
00:00:21,167 --> 00:00:22,839
Aanya: Let's make up a little dance and join them!

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,310
Aanya: Sway this way, then that way. We are dancing with the birds!

7
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:38,533
Aarav: Goodbye, little birds. See you tomorrow!

8
00:00:38,917 --> 00:00:40,263
Aanya: And we will bring a new dance!
